  "notes": "FUNCTIONS:\n- Getting started (energetic tone): さあ、⟦{始|はじ}めよう→始める：00531_hajimeru⟧！ (come on, let's start!); さあ、⟦{行|い}く→行く：00119_iku⟧⟦よ→よ：09475_yo⟧！ (all right, let's go!)\n- Not knowing (drawn out, falling tone): 「⟦いつ→いつ：00536_itsu⟧⟦{届|とど}く→届く：00899_todoku⟧？」「さあ…」 (\"When will it arrive?\" \"Hmm, no idea…\"). A soft way to avoid a direct answer.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦じゃあ→じゃあ：02989_jaa⟧: well then; moves the talk on to a new topic or action.\n- ⟦ええと→ええと：23425_eeto⟧: um, let me see; hesitation while you think of an answer you do have.\n\nWATCH OUT:\n- Answering a superior's question with a bare さあ… sounds offhand; さあ、⟦ちょっと→ちょっと：00595_chotto⟧⟦{分|わ}かりません→分かる：00463_wakaru⟧ is safer.",
